# astrion-skill v1
goal: Raise system volume one step
trigger:
  - phrase: "louder"
  - phrase: "volume up"
  - phrase: "turn up the volume"
do: |
  Raise the system output volume by 10%. Cap at 100%. Emit a
  'volume:set' event on the bus with the new level so the menubar
  speaker indicator updates. Briefly show the new level in a
  notification toast with a volume icon. If running in a context
  with no real audio system (test mode), log a warning and skip
  the actual volume change.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
